/**
 * cajeta-crypto plan 3.1: RS256 and ES256 over OpenSSL (spec 4). The RFC 7515
 * appendix A.2 and A.3 vectors were extracted from the RFC text and verified
 * with Python's cryptography package; the second-source vectors were generated
 * with it on 2026-10-17 and are fixed here.
 */
